{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_02_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_02","title":"察言观色","storyCode":"GT-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f1e956dcf1e8af64b12a3903c95c4ce93f603b2f1ed1f6f705c00de6ed6350eb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"拦什么啊！你没看到他们全部被干掉了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你上啊，你平常不是很厉害吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不行！这家伙可是那个灾星啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）拦住我的都会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）向我挥出武器的都粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）想死的，向前踏出一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟在说些什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？上尉？上尉怎么消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉掉进河里了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这家伙一击就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，忘了他们听不懂......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"说，她在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"她？你指谁？别问我，我什么不知道啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"给、给我记住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你们别急着撤退！先把上尉捞起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那个人是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"她可能是我的同事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，接到这项委托的应该是我啊？我可是好不容易才从陨星姐手里抢到这项任务的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔......也许她是为别的任务来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，赏金猎人好像溃退了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜迟，我们趁现在溜出村子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"既然还有其他干员在这个村子里，说不定事情会好办一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔，楼梯很黑，你要扶紧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，你要和她联络一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，如果可能的话，我想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"噗啊————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我的鼻子！这个门怎么自己弹开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？这里怎么会蹲着人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！发生了什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你们全都给我闭嘴！嘘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你们这些干农活的肯定什么都不懂。没看到那个灾星吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是哪个赏金猎人，都不会想和她碰面的！敢在她面前昂首挺胸的，多半是没见过她毁掉整座城市的样子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"这么夸张吗！那不是靠她一个人就可以把————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"声音轻点，别被她发现！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，可是我还要找她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"说了小声点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉比罗德岛里流传的版本更离谱......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那个怪物走了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好像走了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"总算走了，啊哟，吓死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"原以为这点活我们一队就能搞定，怎么会碰上这种麻烦事。那种家伙都来了的话，得做好准备才能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！拿枪的小子！居然在这里碰见你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"还有村长！你真是送上门来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，你难道是故意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是他们态度那么好，我也没回过神来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"废话少说，把村长交给我们！不然我手里这把刀保证就让你吃足苦头！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"就用那把断刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......这，这小子什么时候出的枪？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"用暗号召集附近还在的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，去把之前用来毁掉农田的虫子都赶出来，让她们尝尝厉害！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
